## Why This Is Asked
Dynamic geometry with batched updates is common in graphics and geo apps. The challenge is to keep per-batch work small while answering existence of a near pair.

## Key Concepts
- Spatial hashing, cell-based locality, squared distance checks to avoid sqrt
- Amortized analysis with localized updates; adapt cell size for density trade-offs

## Code Example
